	skos:inScheme "https://w3id.org/lmodel/d3fend/d3fend_entries"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	skos:note "The ontology declares a domain for few of its properties, so this class lists every property that has none, and any kind of entry may hold it. A narrower kind lists a property only where the ontology declares that domain and this edition obeys it." ;
