	linkml:description "A LinkML model of MITRE D3FEND, the knowledge graph of cybersecurity countermeasures. It models the graph as a catalogue of records: each kind of entry is a class, each property of the ontology is a slot under its own IRI, and every term of D3FEND 1.6.0 is a record that validates against them." ;
