	skos:note "D3FEND declares the domain d3f:Plan, which no one kind here holds whole, so every kind may hold this slot." , "Modeling intent: use to connect plans (like techniques) to the events that would occur when the plan is carried out. This relation does not, by itself, assert that any particular event occurred; only that the plan includes or directs that kind of event. May also be used for design/blueprint-like specifications of artifacts." ;
